Strategy one year goals
title end

paragraph start
One year goals describe the position after four quarters: audience per account, income per stream, products launched and the share of work done by automation. They are set after the ninety day review, because early results show what is realistic.
paragraph end

paragraph start
New creators usually earn little for the first months, so the first year goals include runway, not only income.
paragraph end

